  itemId: author.tool.iron_headed_digger
  displayName: Iron-headed multi-tool
  description: 'A full-length, two-handed iron-headed multi-tool with a transverse
    dual-ended head: a broad downturned hoe/adze-like digging blade on one side and
    a rough blunt iron hammer poll on the other. Its stone-bone shaft, reinforcing
    iron collar, shell butt cap, iron retaining pin and captured gripping-pad scales
    make a more effective prying and shallow-digging tool than the bone version.'
